{"id":"83cb217badb20d86d6a5e747352ab26178872f2b","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/camel","sha":"83cb217badb20d86d6a5e747352ab26178872f2b","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/pages/camel-4x-upgrade-guide-4_24.adoc","lines":["@@ -8638,6 +8638,17 @@ A Vert.x that completes after the timeout is closed, rather than being left join"," `timeout` must now be a positive number of seconds on that path: `timeout=0` used to mean \"do not wait\", which left the"," component without a Vert.x, and is rejected with a clear message instead."," ","+=== camel-jbang - camel run stops when a dependency it was given cannot be downloaded","+","+`camel run` now stops with exit code 1 when a dependency given with `--dep`, `camel.jbang.dependencies`, a `//DEPS`","+line or the dependencies of a Kamelet cannot be downloaded, and prints why on one line, such as","+`ERROR: Cannot download dependency: com.acme:foo:1.0 due to: ... Could not find artifact com.acme:foo:jar:1.0 in central (...)`.","+Before, it logged the error with the stack trace, started the routes without the dependency, and exited with 0.","+In dev mode (`--dev`), a reload with a `//DEPS` line that cannot be downloaded fails, and the routes keep running as","+they were. Other commands of the Camel CLI that fail to download a dependency also exit with 1 and print one line,","+instead of exiting with 70 and printing the stack trace (use `--verbose` for the stack trace). `camel export` still","+writes the dependency to the exported project.","+"," === camel-docling - html_split_page is rejected by docling-serve"," "," `outputFormat=html_split_page` produced an empty body on the docling-serve path: the request asked docling-serve for"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"dsl/camel-jbang/camel-jbang-core/src/main/java/org/apache/camel/dsl/jbang/core/commands/exceptionhandler/CliExecutionExceptionHandler.java","lines":["@@ -30,15 +30,18 @@"," import org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.core.common.JsonOutput;"," import org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.core.common.ResourceDoesNotExist;"," import org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.run.common.Printer;","+import org.apache.camel.main.download.DownloadException;"," "," /**","  * Ends a command that threw an exception: prints the error on stderr, and returns the exit code from","  * {@link CliExitCode}.","  * <p/>","  * A {@link CliException} prints its message as one {@code ERROR:} line, and exits with its code. A file that does not","- * exist exits with {@link CliExitCode#FILE_NOT_FOUND}. Any other exception is unexpected: it prints the error with the","- * stack trace, and exits with {@link CliExitCode#INTERNAL}. With {@code --verbose} or the environment variable","- * {@code CAMEL_CLI_DEBUG=true}, every error prints its stack trace.","+ * exist exits with {@link CliExitCode#FILE_NOT_FOUND}. A dependency that cannot be downloaded (a","+ * {@link DownloadException}) prints its message as one {@code ERROR:} line, and exits with {@link CliExitCode#FAILURE}.","+ * Any other exception is unexpected: it prints the error with the stack trace, and exits with","+ * {@link CliExitCode#INTERNAL}. With {@code --verbose} or the environment variable {@code CAMEL_CLI_DEBUG=true}, every","+ * error prints its stack trace.","  * <p/>","  * A command in JSON mode ({@code --json}) also prints the error as a JSON document on stdout, see {@link JsonOutput}.","  */","@@ -88,6 +91,10 @@ public int getExitCode(Throwable ex) {","         if (fileNotFound(ex) != null) {","             return CliExitCode.FILE_NOT_FOUND;","         }","+        if (find(ex, DownloadException.class) != null) {","+            // such as a dependency that does not exist, or a Maven repository that cannot be reached","+            return CliExitCode.FAILURE;","+        }","         return CliExitCode.INTERNAL;","     }"," ","@@ -105,6 +112,10 @@ private static String message(Throwable ex) {","         } else if (missing != null) {","             return messageOf(missing);","     